  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.12 Complex claim",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.12 “Complex claim” means a claim application that, following the unit’s review, it is not clear that the claimant has exhibited eligibility or the claimant is requesting assistance with relocation expenses.\n\nSource. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
